(Subject: Organizing a Chico Homeless Union - guidance and possible affiliation) Tj
T*
(Hello,) Tj
T*
(We are organizing people currently experiencing homelessness and people with lived experience in Chico,) Tj
T*
(California, to establish an independent membership union. We are learning from the organizing work of the) Tj
T*
(Sacramento Homeless Union, the Berkeley Homeless Union, and the National Union of the Homeless.) Tj
T*
(Our proposed initial priorities are: protecting people from criminal penalties for unavoidable outdoor sleeping) Tj
T*
(when there is nowhere safe and available to go; establishing a permanent City Commission on Housing and) Tj
T*
(Homelessness; and pursuing independent, community-governed operation of the Genesis Pallet Shelter instead of) Tj
T*
(its current contracted operator.) Tj
T*
(Could you share any public or member-shareable formation materials, chapter/charter requirements, bylaws) Tj
T*
(examples, officer-training opportunities, and advice about member-led governance? We would especially) Tj
T*
(appreciate guidance on organizing with people who lack stable addresses or easy digital access.) Tj
T*
(We are not claiming affiliation or endorsement. We would welcome a conversation about what a responsible) Tj
T*
(organizing process could look like.) Tj
T*
(Thank you,) Tj
