T*
(?   [ ] Consider California Secretary of State Form UA-100 \($25\) for a public filed statement; it is not incorporation.) Tj
T*
(?   [ ] Consider LP/UNA 128 for name/insignia registration \($10 per item\), if appropriate.) Tj
T*
(?   [ ] Apply for EIN only after legally forming; an EIN is not proof of tax exemption.) Tj
T*
(?   [ ] Determine whether California AG charitable registration applies if receiving property for charitable) Tj
T*
(    purposes.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(If incorporating as a California nonprofit) Tj
T*
(?   [ ] Have counsel choose the proper CA nonprofit corporate type and SOS articles \(different drafting needs for) Tj
T*
(    501\(c\)\(3\) and other purposes\).) Tj
T*
(?   [ ] File articles with the Secretary of State; designate service-of-process agent and reliable office/mailing) Tj
T*
(    address.) Tj
T*
(?   [ ] File the initial nonprofit Statement of Information within 90 days; continue required periodic filings.) Tj
T*
(?   [ ] Reconcile corporate bylaws and membership/director rules with CA corporation law.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(If seeking federal/state tax exemption) Tj
T*
(?   [ ] For 501\(c\)\(3\): assess charitable/educational qualification, lobbying limits and absolute candidate-) Tj
T*
(    intervention prohibition; review IRS 1023/1023-EZ eligibility.) Tj
T*
(?   [ ] For 501\(c\)\(4\): where applicable, file IRS Form 8976 within 60 days of establishment \(currently $50\); Form) Tj
T*
(    1024-A is a separate optional request for IRS recognition.) Tj
T*
(?   [ ] Apply for California FTB exemption through the appropriate FTB 3500 or 3500A process.) Tj
T*
(?   [ ] File applicable annual IRS and California reports; verify charity registration/renewal obligations.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(For City and service-provider recognition) Tj
T*
(?   [ ] Present a signed member-authorized request to the City Clerk and Council for a meeting/agenda item.) Tj
T*
(?   [ ] Submit a commission-creation proposal separately from the union's independent legal status.) Tj
T*
(?   [ ] Request Genesis contracts, contract amendments, financial reports and written rules through public) Tj
T*
(    records processes.) Tj
T*
(?   [ ] Propose a lawful review of potential operator transition, with qualifications, service continuity and) Tj
T*
(    resident protections.) Tj
